; The two middle greens of the Game Boy's pea green screen (8BAC0F and 306230), shared by every
; RB form's shiny palette. Only the middle pair -- the light and dark ends stay white and black
; as they are for every other mon, so a shiny RB form reads as green-shaded art rather than as
; a Game Boy screen.

